 event or business day."},{"title":"Fan-Facing Recycling Programs","description":"Branded recycling stations and clear signage that encourage proper waste sorting. Help your fans be part of your sustainability story."},{"title":"Vendor & Concession Coordination","description":"We work directly with food vendors and concession operators to manage back-of-house waste streams, grease disposal, and cardboard recycling."}],"faqs":[{"question":"How quickly can you mobilize for an unplanned event?","answer":"We maintain standby capacity in major markets and can typically deploy additional resources within 24-48 hours for unexpected needs. For regular clients, we build surge capacity into your service plan."},{"question":"Do you handle specialty waste from events?","answer":"Yes, we manage all event waste streams including food waste, cooking oil, cardboard from vendors, and specialty items. We also coordinate hazardous waste disposal for pyrotechnics and other special effects materials."},{"question":"Can you provide waste diversion reporting for sustainability goals?","answer":"Absolutely. We provide detailed post-event reports showing total waste volumes, recycling rates, and diversion metrics. Many of our venue partners use these reports for LEED certification and corporate sustainability reporting."},{"question":"How do you handle waste during multi-day festivals?","answer":"For multi-day events, we establish on-site command centers and maintain continuous service. We perform rolling cleanups, manage overflow, and ensure facilities remain clean throughout the entire event duration."},{"question":"What's your approach to fan-facing waste stations?","answer":"We design and deploy clear, intuitive waste stations that make it easy for fans to sort correctly. This includes color-coded bins, clear signage, and strategic placement based on traffic flow analysis."}]}],["$L7","$L8","$L9"],"$La"]}],{},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false]},null,false,false],"$Lb",false]],"m":"$undefined","G":["$c",[]],"S":true}
